      "writtenOn": "2018-03-01T03:33:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just measured on hikey and saw max hold time of 23.96 us (average 0.68) and max wait time of 25 us (average 1.89). The kernel I measured with includes the change to do uid accounting in acct_update_power (not yet uploaded), without that change I would expect worse contention due to the need to take this lock when reading /proc/uid_time_in_state.",
